{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"carrot_bunch","model_identifier":"carrot_bunch","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## carrot_bunch\n\nCarried load, plants.\n\n- Cubes: 10 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.0..2.0, y -8.5..5.0, z -2.0..2.0 (size 4.0 x 13.5 x 4.0 u = 11 x 38 x 11 cm).\nCarrot bunch: four orange carrots hanging below the fist (held by the tops), the leafy green tops sticking up. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 8.5.\n"},"description":"## carrot_bunch\n\nCarried load, plants.\n\n- Cubes: 10 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.0..2.0, y -8.5..5.0, z -2.0..2.0 (size 4.0 x 13.5 x 4.0 u = 11 x 38 x 11 cm).\nCarrot bunch: four orange carrots hanging below the fist (held by the tops), the leafy green tops sticking up. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 8.5.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"carrot_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.6,-6.5,-1.1],"to":[-0.4,-0.5,0.09999999999999998],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16,0,17.2,6.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[18,0,19.2,6.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[20,0,21.2,6.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[22,0,23.2,6.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[12,12,13.2,13.2],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[14,12,15.2,13.2],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"b4ef96d1-c516-53d8-b004-7d82b656943d"},{"name":"tip_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.25,-7.5,-0.75],"to":[-0.75,-6